cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "如果 PaperToTalk 帮你省下了搭管线的时间，可以按下面的信息引用。"
title: "Prism (PaperToTalk): a local-first academic English workbench"
abstract: >-
  PaperToTalk connects Zotero and Yomitan highlights to Anki, combines
  Academic Phrasebank style rhetorical moves with LTeX+ grammar checks and
  Vale style rules for paper writing, and uses Kokoro, YouGlish, Whisper,
  Praat and mpvacious for spoken academic English practice. Prism is the
  local workbench that ties these into one window. The project is a personal
  learning system, not a validated assessment instrument.
authors:
  - family-names: "Xing"
    given-names: "Haoming"
    alias: "Lumenhao"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-30"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lumenhao/PaperToTalk"
keywords:
  - academic english
  - anki
  - zotero
  - phrasebank
  - speech analysis
  - praat
  - whisper
